## Verification record

Marking context verified requires an entry naming all of: the reviewed scope, the revision it was reviewed against, the reviewer, the date and the evidence. A changed basis — pin, authority or context content — reopens verification for the affected scope.

| Verified scope | Revision | Reviewer | Date | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|
